From e09df9b0794dece3faa84a7415da619e285f5ec5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:23:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Single-game title mode for the Installation 08 app

PW_FIXED_PROFILE starts one profile from Home, copies a bundled library to
the data folder on first start, and closes (or restarts on a flag) when the
game ends. build_native.sh takes a title id, a local Lapy helper, sce_sys
folder and extra compiler flags.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017heTRKLYxAFfzQ4NtBUsib
---
